# 9. My architectural assessment

The architecture has become **much stronger**, but it is also becoming clear that we have **three different architectures intertwined**:

### A. KnowledgeOS product/runtime architecture

> What software should eventually exist?

### B. KnowledgeOS epistemic architecture

> What is knowledge, evidence, authority, provenance, determination, identity and validity?

### C. KnowledgeOS research/reconstruction architecture

> How do we establish that A and B are actually justified by the historical corpus?

These must remain separate.

